+++ b/release-notes/1.5.9.md
@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@
+# Xiaok CLI & Desktop 1.5.9
+
+## 更新 / Changes
+
+- CLI 将 SubAgent / Thinking 清除和绘制合为完整终端帧，避免 120ms 多次写入导致闪烁；草稿和正文保留。
+- CLI 图片读取向支持视觉的模型传递经过校验的图片；终端内嵌图片保留在对话历史里。
+- Desktop 实时输出和历史回放按工具边界分段，减少重复结果；执行审批在聊天内展示，提供明确选择的本任务相同操作自动批准，参数变化、其他执行主体与新任务不继承。
+- 模型连接中断恢复保留已执行工具结果；无正常结果的关闭提供可理解的说明。
+- MCP tool events 转发调用进度。
+
+## 发布范围 / Release scope
+
+CLI / Desktop metadata: 1.5.9. npm package: xiaokcode. Tags: cli-v1.5.9 and desktop-v1.5.9.
+
+Pinned siblings: kswarm d4be3121e04af16c65065f5917e67a66930ca132; intent-broker 079181041c99985da45444505090b13d6d8e26bc; kai-xiaok-plugins a5b473ca1aeed16b85ccf43c4981990ad1fd13ee.
+
+主目录和关联项目中未提交的其他任务代码不进入本次发布。Local builds are unsigned verification artifacts; hosted signed installers and npm registry availability are checked separately.
+
+## 验证 / Validation
+
+- Isolated CLI release build and version smoke: 1.5.9. Fresh npm-registry installation also reports 1.5.9; the published CLI PTY preparation script and a real native-PTY spawn smoke passed. CLI focused regressions: 203 passed; lint and architecture gates: zero new violations.
+- Flicker repair: 142 focused terminal tests passed; real tmux production activity rendering sampled 240 frames with zero blank activity observations and draft editing preserved. Full CLI terminal E2E 1–31 passed with 97 local SSE requests.
+- Desktop main/renderer build and typecheck clean. Focused Desktop regressions: 125 passed, with a further 20 packaged-runtime import tests passed after extracting the checksum-verified Electron cache archive.
+- Report renderer clean dependency install, build and bundle: unchanged generated bundle; 247 tests passed. Lock-file mirror URLs were changed to official npm registry URLs with package versions and integrity values preserved.
+- Pinned slide Python closures: darwin-arm64 659 entries and win32-x64 926 entries verified. Local interpreter smoke used the vendored closure. Only generated bytecode from the smoke was removed before the canonical verification; manifest was not altered.
+- npm registry confirms `xiaokcode@1.5.9` and `latest=1.5.9`. The downloaded tarball integrity matches the published SHA-512 and its compiled activity renderer is byte-identical to `cli-v1.5.9`; both Windows runtime absence helpers are present. Main checkout and KSwarm unrelated WIP remain excluded. Primary repo hygiene reports that unrelated KSwarm WIP; the selected release sibling worktrees use committed source.
+- One extra legacy managed-Python rendering check failed because the existing user-level interpreter was terminated with signal 9. It is not the vendored interpreter; the clean report/MCP bundling tests and vendored-runtime gates passed. This is not a full product/provider/device acceptance claim.
+
+GitHub Desktop release is published as the latest release. Workflow run 37328111628 attempt 2 passed all four jobs: draft creation, macOS build/signing/notarization, Windows installer and packaged Kimi K3 smoke, and pre/post-publication updater-asset verification. A separate local invocation of the production hosted-release verifier also passed. All five required assets are present; this does not claim the locally installed Desktop app has been upgraded or restarted.
+
+## Published CLI
+
+- npm: https://www.npmjs.com/package/xiaokcode/v/1.5.9
+- GitHub: https://github.com/kaisersong/xiaok-cli/releases/tag/cli-v1.5.9
+- Published tarball SHA-1: `4b71160e14241605825ef0d359753ea9c32c6e7d`.
+- Desktop release workflow: https://github.com/kaisersong/xiaok-cli/actions/runs/37328111628
